      "kind": "paragraph",
      "topic": "SQLi 关键词过滤：重叠双写绕过",
      "section": [
        "SQLi 关键词过滤：重叠双写绕过",
        "When"
      ],
      "content": "输入进入 SQL，但 WAF/过滤器把 or、and、union、select、from、where、information_schema 等关键词**单次全局删除或替换一次**。",
      "line_start": 11,
      "line_end": 11,
      "truncated": false
    },
    {
      "source_uri": "file:///Users/scemac/My_github/Aegis/knowledge/techniques/cards/web-sqli-double-write.md",
      "source_kind": "local_document",
      "verified": false,
      "action_policy": "none",
      "source_digest": "sha256:1dbdd434be4936b7217bc429c3f64cb02fbe1183ded5bc5cce1f137e95e887bc",
      "compiler_version": "1.0.0",
      "kind": "heading",
      "topic": "SQLi 关键词过滤：重叠双写绕过",
      "section": [
        "SQLi 关键词过滤：重叠双写绕过",
        "Do"
      ],
      "content": "Do",
      "line_start": 13,
      "line_end": 13,
      "truncated": false
    },
    {
      "source_uri": "file:///Users/scemac/My_github/Aegis/knowledge/techniques/cards/web-sqli-double-write.md",
      "source_kind": "local_document",
      "verified": false,
      "action_policy": "none",
      "source_digest": "sha256:1dbdd434be4936b7217bc429c3f64cb02fbe1183ded5bc5cce1f137e95e887bc",
      "compiler_version": "1.0.0",
      "kind": "list",
      "topic": "SQLi 关键词过滤：重叠双写绕过",
      "section": [
        "SQLi 关键词过滤：重叠双写绕过",
        "Do"
      ],
      "content": "1. 逐个确认哪些关键词被删/替换，以及是否只处理一次（单次全局替换，不递归）。\n2. 把关键词写成重叠形式，让删除后仍留下原词：union→uniunionon，select→seselectlect，from→frfromom，information_schema→infoorrmation_schema。\n3. 注意 where→wwherehere（两个 where 重叠），不能写 wherewhere（两个都会被删）。\n4. 先用布尔/错误差异确认 payload 生效，再用 UNION 探列数与回显位。",
      "line_start": 14,
      "line_end": 17,
      "truncated": false
    },
